            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I think maybe there should be an improvement, as we could access and assign array item via string type index. In fact, `a[1]` is equal to `a['1']`. Refer http://www.ecma-international.org/ecma-262/5.1/#sec-15.4\r\n\r\nWe could check the key, and try to convert it to a number type. https://github.com/vuejs/vue/blob/1648adb6c7bcc8a3a8dd887640858051ce4dc58d/src/core/observer/index.js#L192",
